<%#
  OneUptime AI's investigation of incident #1042, as the incident page shows
  it: the summary, the most likely root cause with the evidence it cites,
  the next steps, and the button that opens a fix pull request. Drawn after
  the real AI Investigation card.
-%>
<%
  const evidence = [
    'p95 of <code class="rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 font-mono text-[10.5px] text-gray-800">http.server.request.duration</code> for checkout-api rose from ~310 ms to 2.35 s after 17:52',
    '<code class="rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 font-mono text-[10.5px] text-gray-800">db.client.connections.usage</code> stayed pinned at 10 from 17:58',
    'The slowest trace spent 1.94 s of 2.31 s in <code class="rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 font-mono text-[10.5px] text-gray-800">pg.pool.connect</code>',
  ];
-%>
<div role="img" aria-label="OneUptime AI's investigation of incident 1042, marked investigation complete. Summary: checkout-api restarted at 17:52 with its database pool cut from 40 to 10 connections, so checkout requests queued and p95 latency passed 2 seconds, the same pool exhaustion as incidents 1017, 1029 and 1036. Most likely root cause: release 2026.09.14-2 started with the pool configured at max 10, previously 40. Evidence: p95 latency rose from about 310 milliseconds to 2.35 seconds, connection usage stayed pinned at 10, and the slowest trace spent 1.94 of 2.31 seconds waiting for a connection. Suggested next step: roll back or redeploy with DB_POOL_MAX=40. A button opens a fix pull request from the analysis. The investigation was read-only: nothing in your systems was changed.">
  <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-white text-left shadow-[0_24px_60px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] ring-1 ring-gray-900/10">
    <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 px-5 pb-3 pt-4">
      <div>
        <p class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-gray-950">AI Investigation</p>
        <p class="mt-0.5 text-[12px] text-gray-500">OneUptime AI's root-cause report for incident #1042.</p>
      </div>
      <span class="inline-flex flex-none items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10.5px] font-medium text-emerald-700 ring-1 ring-inset ring-emerald-200">
        <svg class="h-3 w-3" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
        Investigation complete
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3 px-5 pb-5">
      <!-- Summary -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-indigo-100 bg-indigo-50/60 p-4">
        <p class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[10.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-700">
          <span class="flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-indigo-600 text-white"><svg class="h-3 w-3" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.813 15.904L9 18.75l-.813-2.846a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09-3.09L2.25 12l2.846-.813a4.5 4.5 0 003.09-3.09L9 5.25l.813 2.846a4.5 4.5 0 003.09 3.09L15.75 12l-2.846.813a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09 3.09z" /></svg></span>
          Summary
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2.5 text-[13px] font-semibold leading-relaxed text-gray-950">checkout-api restarted at 17:52 with its database pool cut from 40 to 10 connections, so checkout requests queued and p95 latency passed 2s - the same pool exhaustion as #1017, #1029 and #1036.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Most likely root cause -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50/70 p-4">
        <p class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[10.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-700">
          <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.75" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 18v-5.25m0 0a6.01 6.01 0 001.5-.189m-1.5.189a6.01 6.01 0 01-1.5-.189m3.75 7.478a12.06 12.06 0 01-4.5 0m3.75 2.383a14.406 14.406 0 01-3 0M14.25 18v-.192c0-.983.658-1.823 1.508-2.316a7.5 7.5 0 10-7.517 0c.85.493 1.509 1.333 1.509 2.316V18" /></svg>
          Most likely root cause
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-gray-800">Release <span class="font-medium">2026.09.14-2</span> of checkout-api started at 17:52:04 with <code class="rounded bg-white/80 px-1 font-mono text-[10.5px] ring-1 ring-amber-200">db pool configured max=10</code> (previously max=40). Under evening load the pool sat at its ceiling, and checkout requests waited up to 2s for a connection.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Evidence -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-4">
        <p class="text-[12px] font-semibold text-gray-950">Evidence</p>
        <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5">
          <% evidence.forEach(function (item) { -%>
          <li class="flex gap-2 text-[11.5px] leading-relaxed text-gray-600"><span class="mt-[7px] h-1 w-1 flex-none rounded-full bg-gray-400"></span><span><%- item %></span></li>
          <% }); -%>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[12px] font-semibold text-gray-950">Suggested next step</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-[11.5px] leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Roll checkout-api back to 2026.09.14-1, or redeploy with <code class="rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 font-mono text-[10.5px] text-gray-800">DB_POOL_MAX=40</code>, and confirm p95 returns below 500 ms.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Act on it -->
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3">
        <div class="min-w-0">
          <p class="text-[12px] font-semibold text-gray-950">Act on this investigation</p>
          <p class="truncate text-[11px] text-gray-500">Open a fix pull request with this report as context.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="inline-flex flex-none items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-3 py-1.5 text-[11.5px] font-medium text-white">
          <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.25 6.75L22.5 12l-5.25 5.25m-10.5 0L1.5 12l5.25-5.25m7.5-3l-4.5 16.5" /></svg>
          Open fix PR
        </span>
      </div>

      <p class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-gray-500">
        <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-emerald-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.75" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z" /></svg>
        Read-only - nothing in your systems was changed · 10 telemetry queries
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
